  "brain_first": "“不要只听情绪词，听语气 + 评价词 + 行为反应。”",
  "sort_order": 1009,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 403
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "How does X feel? / What is X's attitude",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 404
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "toward...?",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 405
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 406
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "态度是对某件事的评价方向；情绪是人物当时的心",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 407
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "理状态。",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 408
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “不要只听情绪词，听语气 + 评价词 + 行为反应。”",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 409
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 人物常不会直接说 I am disappointed，而会说 I expected much better。",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 410
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 411
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 先把选项情绪方向标成正/负/中性。",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 412
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 听评价词：great, worth, disappointing, worried, relieved 等。",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 413
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 听行为反应：拒绝、赞同、感谢、抱怨、犹豫。",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 414
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 如果语气和词义冲突，以完整语境为准。",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 415
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 题号旁只记最短符号：关键词 / old→new / + / - / ?。数字写成“30→25”，计",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 416
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "划写成“drive→sleep”；不要抄完整句。",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 417
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 418
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· “At least...” 常表示勉强接受/安慰",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 419
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· “I can't believe...” 可能惊讶，需看后文是好是坏",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 420
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· “That's a relief.” → relieved",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 421
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 评价方向和人物反应都指向同一情绪。",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 422
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 两个词都像时，比较强度：concerned < angry；surprised 不等于",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 423
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "disappointed。",
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "sourceIndex": 424
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 425
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The hotel room was smaller than the photos suggested, but the staff were wonderful.",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 426
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "若问对“staff”的态度：positive/satisfied；别被前半句房间负面信息带跑。",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 427
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 428
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把说话人对A的态度套到B。",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 429
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只因一个负面词就选最强负面情绪。",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 430
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 431
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 题目问的是哪个对象？",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 432
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 情绪强度合适吗？",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 433
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： L-K 关键词漏听｜L-C 改口没更新｜L-P 同",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 434
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义替换没认出｜L-I 推断过远｜L-A 态度对象/强度错。",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 435
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 436
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 情绪看对象、方向和强度。",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 437
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 439
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. “That’s a relief.”情绪？",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 440
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. “I expected much better.”更可能？",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 441
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. “The room was small, but the staff were wonderful.”问对staff态度？",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 442
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. concerned 与 furious 哪个强度更弱？",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 443
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. “I can’t believe it!”能否单独判断正负？",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 444
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. relieved；2. disappointed；3. positive/satisfied；4. concerned；5. 不能，看后文。",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 445
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— L6 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“L6”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 16,
      "sourceIndex": 446
    }
  ],
